[00:00.54] Keep me clean, keep me warm
[00:04.14] Keep my soul away from harm
[00:13.58] Keep the night, keep the day
[00:33.48] Keep the in between away.
[01:04.36] Hold that second, hold the time
[01:10.98] Hold that picture in your mind
[01:15.44] Hold the smoke, hold the fire
[01:22.26] Hold all that you desire
[01:26.88] Show me trust, show me love
[01:30.02] Show me heaven up above
[01:30.18] Show your soul show your mind
[01:30.18] Show it to me all the time
